      "text": "A particle moves along a line, and its position \\( s(t) \\) satisfies the differential equation \\( \\frac{ds}{dt} = 6 \\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)} \\) with \\( s(0) = -2 \\). Writing the particular solution as \\( s(t) = -2 + \\int_{0}^{t} v(u) \\, du \\), where \\( v \\) is the given rate, find the exact value of \\( s(\\frac{\\pi}{9}) \\)."
   },
